    "description": "Moves an upcoming appointment to a new time. Finds it by appointment_id or by phone (the soonest upcoming visit, or the one on a given date), rejects a closed or already-booked slot, updates the Google Calendar event, then updates the appointment row and logs appointment.rescheduled. Called directly by the ElevenLabs voice agent's reschedule tool. See /docs/N8N_WORKFLOWS.md."
  },
